{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Build 3 horizontal custom SVG icons for “How We Work With You”
    Global rules (apply to all three)
    
    Format: inline SVG, not PNG.
    
    Palette: black #000000 and Rebel Nell pink #C81688 only. Background transparent.
    
    Style: bold outline, square corners (no rounded ends), simple geometry.
    
    Size box: each icon fits in a 160×160 viewBox and uses the same stroke width so they look identical in weight at any size.
    
    Accessibility: role="img" with accurate aria-label.
    
    Motion: animations must pause for prefers-reduced-motion: reduce.
    
    Layout: place all three icons side-by-side in a single row; on mobile keep them horizontal using a scroll container (display:flex; gap:24px; overflow-x:auto; scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;) with each icon wrapped in a scroll-snap-align:start item. Do not stack vertically on mobile., Icon 1 — “1. Discover Together” (Magnifying glass)
    
    Must look like a real magnifying glass. No extra circles.
    
    Lens
    
    One circle stroke only, no fill.
    
    Stroke: black, 8–10 px (so it reads at small sizes).
    
    Pink sparkles live inside the lens (top-left quadrant). They must be clipped to the circle using clipPath so nothing bleeds outside.
    
    Handle
    
    A solid black rectangle rotated 40–45°, emerging from the lens at ~4 o’clock.
    
    Square edges (no rounding), thickness visually proportional to the bezel (not a hairline).
    
    Connect the handle to the lens with a short rectangular connector if needed—no rings, no extra open circles.
    
    Animation (sparkles)
    
    2–3 small pink stars/diamonds that twinkle (scale 0.8→1.1 and fade 0.2→1.0) on staggered loops (2–3s).
    
    Respect prefers-reduced-motion: reduce (disable animation).
    
    Accessibility
    
    aria-label="Magnifying glass with pink sparkles"
    
    Acceptance checks
    
    Only one circle (the lens).
    
    Handle is a solid rotated rectangle at 40–45°, aligned to the lens rim.
    
    Pink sparkles are visible and entirely inside the lens., the rectangle show come out of the circle  , fix the discover together icon to look like a realistic magnifying glass currently the hand is not come out from the side of the circle , Icon 2 — “2. Co-Create Options” (Two chat boxes)
    
    Shapes
    
    Two square-corner chat boxes, equal size, slightly overlapping.
    
    Box A: left, tail on bottom-left edge.
    
    Box B: right, mirrored horizontally, tail on bottom-right edge.
    
    Lines & fill
    
    Boxes: black outline, no fill.
    
    Inner message lines in pink #C81688 (3 lines per box, short-medium-short).
    
    Animation
    
    Subtle “conversation” effect: alternate opacity or y-nudges of the pink lines (A speaks, then B speaks), 1.8–2.2s loop, out-of-phase.
    
    Respect reduced motion.
    
    Accessibility
    
    aria-label="Two overlapping chat boxes exchanging messages"
    
    Acceptance checks
    
    Tails are exactly bottom-left (Box A) and bottom-right (Box B).
    
    Pink lines appear inside each box; no fills.
    
    Both boxes are same size and perfectly aligned/overlapped., Do not draw any small open circle near the handle. The magnifying glass has one circle (the lens) only and one rectangular handle rotated 40–45°., Icon 3 — “3. Activate & Amplify” (Fireworks)
    
    Concept
    
    Replace plant/flower with multiple fireworks bursts to represent activation/amplification.
    
    Shapes & color
    
    2–3 radial bursts: one pink main burst in front, 1–2 black secondary bursts behind.
    
    Use straight line segments (no circles), square caps to match the square aesthetic.
    
    Animation
    
    Staggered scale + radial stroke-draw or opacity so bursts “pop.”
    
    Loop 2.5–3s; ensure nothing exceeds the 160×160 viewBox.
    
    Respect reduced motion.
    
    Accessibility
    
    aria-label="Animated fireworks bursts representing activation and amplification"
    
    Acceptance checks
    
    At least two bursts visible at all times.
    
    The pink burst is prominent; others provide depth.
    
    No curves or rounded caps; straight segments only.
    
    Row content (under each icon)
    
    Title and subheader text to render under each icon (same typographic scale across the three).
    
    1. Discover Together — sub: “Start with your goals and challenges.”
    
    2. Co-Create Options — sub: “Tailored experiences and branded takeaways that matter.”
    
    3. Activate & Amplify — sub: “Bring it to life and extend your impact.”, the activate and amplify should be fireworks
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-how-we-work-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 0 {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
  }

  .ai-how-we-work-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 20px;
  }

  .ai-how-we-work-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.title_margin_bottom }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ai-how-we-work-icons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 24px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
  }

  .ai-how-we-work-icons-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-how-we-work-icon-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    text-align: center;
    min-width: 200px;
  }

  .ai-how-we-work-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 160px;
    height: 160px;
    margin: 0 auto {{ block.settings.icon_margin_bottom }}px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-how-we-work-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 160px;
    max-height: 160px;
  }

  .ai-how-we-work-icon-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.icon_title_size }}px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: {{ block.settings.icon_title_color }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.icon_title_margin_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-how-we-work-icon-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.icon_description_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.icon_description_color }};
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .ai-how-we-work-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} * {
      animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
      transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-how-we-work-icons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      justify-content: center;
      overflow-x: visible;
      scroll-snap-type: none;
    }

    .ai-how-we-work-icon-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 1;
      max-width: 300px;
      min-width: auto;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

